<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53086" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κανθαρ-ίς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ίδος</span>,
			ἡ, a kind of <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>beetle</i>, prob. <i>blister-beetle, Cantharis
				vesicatoria</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				531b25
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				542a9
			</span></i>; used in medicine, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Nat.Mul.</u>
				32
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.22a
			</span></i>: pl., <i><span class="en">
				<u>POxy.</u>
				1088.14
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>; <i>beetle hurtful to corn</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.Com.
				37
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				8.10.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				115
			</span></i>; also to fruits, etc., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				552b1
			</span></i>; so prob. in <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.363
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> a kind of
				<i>fish</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Numen.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				7.326f
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
